		(property "Design Notes" "ESD clamp for all four user-accessible SIM lines (VDD/IO/CLK/RST) - Quectel 3.3 requires a TVS array with parasitic capacitance <= 15 pF at the holder; this part is ~0.25 pF/channel. The SIM holder is the only user-accessible connector on the cellular subsystem, so it is the realistic ESD entry point. Place at the holder, not the socket."
