				)
			)
		)
		(property "Design Notes" "UART only - no USB, no I2C, no SPI. D_SEL (pin 2) is left open to select UART plus I2C; grounding it would select SPI. V_USB (pin 7) is tied to GND as IM 4.2.3 requires when USB is unused, and V_BCKP (pin 22) is tied to VCC per IM 4.2.2 because no separate backup source is fitted. Reserved pins 15 to 17 stay unconnected. Take the footprint and paste mask from IM Figures 37 and 38, and keep out the de-panel residual tabs (up to 0.5 mm) on one long edge. The VCC ramp is a part-damaging spec: 20 to 8000 us/V, i.e. 66 us to 26.4 ms for the 0 to 3.3 V rise (Datasheet Table 10 note 7)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "70eafb09-02b4-481f-bd19-85dc47edb142")
			(effects
