		(at 74.49 91.875)
		(descr "Littelfuse SMTO-263 / DO-218AB-compatible TVS package, per Littelfuse SM8S datasheet 'Recommend Soldering Pad Outline' (tab pad 10.50x2.16 + 8.89x7.01, lead pad 3.00x2.30, 15.27 overall). Pad 1 = lead = CATHODE (band side), pad 2 = tab = ANODE. Datasheet pads are the minimum: extend pad 2 copper into the GND pour for the 7kW/8W pulse+thermal duty.")
