				)
			)
		)
		(property "Design Notes" "Socket-local overvoltage clamp on 3V3_CELL (legacy ref D_cell): the front-end TVS D2 is far away at the harness entry. Cathode to +3V3_CELL, anode to GND - reverse-biased in normal operation. Selection: 3.6 V working voltage equals the card max operating rail (Quectel Table 21, no abs max published), lowest clamp class available above the operating window. Place at the J5 power pins on the same pour as the C57-C61 bank. Symbol reuses the farseer_library SM8S26A drawing (unidirectional K/A) - only the graphic is shared, part data here is authoritative. Verify AEC-Q101 suffix at order (alt: Diodes Inc SMAJ3.6AQ-13-F)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
