		(property "Design Notes" "The 1 uF that Integration manual section 4.9.1 asks for as a checklist item: a 1 uF cap right next to the module VCC pin. Layout: this must be the capacitor closest to pin 23, on a large low-impedance pad with generous vias down to the power layer (IM 4.8.4.2)."
