		(property "Design Notes" "Second 10 uF reservoir on the VCC rail, placed nearest the module. V_BCKP (pin 22) is tied to VCC here, so this and C48 are also what hold up the RTC and battery-backed RAM through a brief rail dip. No series resistance is allowed on the V_BCKP line (IM 4.2.2)."
