		(descr "Mini PCI Express socket, 52-pin, full-size, 5.75mm height, Molex 679105700. Land pattern per PCI Express Mini Card CEM spec r1.2 Fig 2-11/2-13 = Molex SD-67910-001 recommended PCB layout: 0.6x2.0mm pads, 0.8mm pitch, rows at +/-3.10mm; locator holes D1.6 (datum E) and D1.1 at 25.00mm; card hold-down line at 48.05mm (Molex 48099-4000 latch, see SD-48099-400). Hosts Quectel BG95-M3 Mini PCIe card (51x30mm full-size), see Quectel BG95-M3 Mini PCIe Hardware Design V1.0 ch.7")
