		(property "Design Notes" "GNSS antenna feed. The footprint SMA_Amphenol_132289_EdgeMount is drawn for this exact part, so confirm the finished board thickness matches the connector's slot before ordering - an edge-mount SMA is thickness-specific. RF_IN must arrive here as a via-shielded grounded co-planar 50 Ohm waveguide with no stubs (IM 4.8.4.1). Site the antenna as far from the BG95 antenna as the install allows."
